Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:02:12.53,0:02:14.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Acaba kar mı yağacak?Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.53,0:02:16.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nasıl yağabilir?Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.03,0:02:19.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Elbette yağabilir! Uyuyordun, bu yüzden bilmiyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.20,0:02:20.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hah?Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.87,0:02:23.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey. Yeniden kar yağacak, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.79,0:02:28.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu mümkün ama o ilk deniz bölgesi çok özeldi.Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.42,0:02:33.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Reverse Mountain'den gelen 7 manyetik alan yüzünden çılgıncaydı.Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.10,0:02:39.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ancak, burada da gardınızı düşürmemelisiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.43,0:02:43.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Deniz, yola çıktığımız zamanki kadar haşin olmayabilir...Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.94,0:02:48.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ama kesinlikle normal denizlerden daha kötü olacak.Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.02,0:02:51.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu denizi asla hafife almayın.Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.07,0:02:52.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu kesin bir kuraldır.Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.40,0:02:54.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, çocuklar!Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.07,0:02:57.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Özel içeceğimin tadına bakmaya ne dersiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.03,0:03:00.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oley!Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.54,0:03:04.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eline sağlık!Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.71,0:03:09.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp.Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.79,0:03:11.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bize olta yap.Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.46,0:03:13.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Olta mı? İyi fikir!Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.72,0:03:14.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam!Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.80,0:03:17.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bize sanatsal oltalar yapacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.10,0:03:21.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vay, silip süpürdün.Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Güzel, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.19,0:03:27.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Müthiş!Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.81,0:03:29.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vay! Harikasın, Karoo!Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.27,0:03:32.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nasıl böyle rahatlar?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.11,0:03:33.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte, seninki.Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.53,0:03:34.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.03,0:03:36.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir şey olmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.45,0:03:40.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fırtına gelirse ne yapacaklarını biliyorlar.Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.28,0:03:41.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yaşamayı onlar da istiyor.Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.83,0:03:44.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öyle ama...Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.75,0:03:46.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,çok dikkatsiz görünüyorlar.Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.00,0:03:50.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir gemide endişelerin kalmayacak.Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.46,0:03:57.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aferin! İç, iç, iç, iç!Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.85,0:04:03.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şapşal Karoo!Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.27,0:04:12.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet, çok rahatlatıcı.Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.36,0:04:19.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey millet, bakın!Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.82,0:04:20.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir yunus balığı!Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.24,0:04:22.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vay! Çok tatlı!Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.80,0:04:36.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Devasa!Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.27,0:04:50.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kımıldayın!Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.02,0:04:52.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gidelim!Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.81,0:04:54.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Evet! – Hıhı!Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.11,0:05:00.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ!Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.61,0:05:02.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şu taraf...!Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.53,0:05:03.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben de!Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.03,0:05:05.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Millet...Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.08,0:05:07.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yelkenler fora!Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.21,0:05:19.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam!Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.01,0:05:21.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalgayı yakalayıp yunustan uzaklaşalım!Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.61,0:05:37.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Rotamız ne alemde?Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.28,0:05:38.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir saniye.Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.28,0:05:39.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bakayım.Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.82,0:05:46.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gemiyi iskele tarafına döndürün!Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.25,0:05:51.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Hayhay! – Hayhay!Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.98,0:06:13.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hiç şüphesiz.Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.81,0:06:16.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaktüs Adası'yla aynı hizadayız.Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.15,0:06:18.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir sonraki hedefimiz...Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.19,0:06:20.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,o ada!Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.33,0:06:34.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte!Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.08,0:06:36.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Grand Line'daki ikinci adamız!Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.31,0:06:57.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bay 3...Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne var?Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.44,0:06:59.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir saniye.Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.19,0:07:05.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Earl Grey'e hiçbir çay rakip olamaz.Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.19,0:07:05.07,Note-207-,,0,0,0,,Earl Grey: Dünyaca ünlü bir çay türü.Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.45,0:07:06.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sıkıldım.Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.24,0:07:11.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sıkıldığını ısrarla söylüyorsun ama işe de karşısın, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.29,0:07:11.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doğru.Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.87,0:07:18.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O zaman neden bu harika tatilin tadını çıkarmıyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.00,0:07:24.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uzun süreli tatiller, yalnızca rütbeli ajanlara tanınan bir ayrıcalıktır.Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.76,0:07:26.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir şey daha...Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.76,0:07:31.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,halka açık yerlerde dikkatsizce kod adımı kullanmayı bırak.Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.22,0:07:36.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İnsanlar gerçekten Bay 3 olduğumu keşfedebilir.Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.60,0:07:39.61,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,Hadi ya?Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.48,0:07:46.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu arada, o kağıdı günlerdir gözünden ayırmıyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.78,0:07:48.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nedir o?Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Patronun emirleri.Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.99,0:07:52.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Baştan söylesene!Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.54,0:07:58.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Demek Bay 5'in icabına bakıldı.Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.21,0:08:03.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eğer Bay 2 olsaydı daha mutlu olurdum.Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.38,0:08:06.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Böylece terfi alırdık, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.88,0:08:11.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bay 5'in yenilgisi büyütülecek bir şey değil.Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.14,0:08:18.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sadece rütbesini ve gücünü abartan bir acemi o kadar.Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.69,0:08:22.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şeytan meyvesi yeteneklerin ne kadar güçlü olursa olsun,Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.19,0:08:27.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,kullanmakta tamamen ustalaşmazsan hiçbir işe yaramazsın.Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.49,0:08:39.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,En kusursuz suçlar, en kusursuz zihinlerden çıkar!Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.04,0:08:43.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunu yapan her kimse,Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.04,0:08:48.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,örgütümüze karşı gelmenin dehşetini ona gösterelim!Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.89,0:09:02.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Demek burası Little Garden!Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.89,0:09:02.69,Note-207-,,0,0,0,,Little Garden: Küçük BahçeDialogue: 50,0:09:02.69,0:09:04.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunun neresi "küçük"?Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.82,0:09:08.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Adı gibi sevimli durmuyor.Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.15,0:09:11.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,K-Keşfedilmemiş bir ada gibi.Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.36,0:09:12.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yabani bir orman!Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.99,0:09:15.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dikkatli olmalıyız.Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.03,0:09:18.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bayan All-Sunday'in söyledikleri aklımdan çıkmıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.87,0:09:22.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C-C-Canavarlar olacağı anlamına mı geliyor bu?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.25,0:09:23.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kim bilir?Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.58,0:09:27.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burada durmadan bir sonraki adaya gidelim!Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.21,0:09:30.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama seyirin ayarlanması için beklemek gerekiyor.Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.09,0:09:33.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca yiyecek de stoklamamız lazım.Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.51,0:09:36.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Son kasabadan hiçbir şey alamadık.Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.47,0:09:38.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İleride bir nehir var!Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.27,0:09:40.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Ne? – Cidden mi?Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.61,0:09:47.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Umarım mangal restoranı buluruz.Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.44,0:09:48.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bok bulursun!Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.90,0:09:51.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yiyecek stoklamaya ne oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.36,0:09:53.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Malzeme toplamalıyız diyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.28,0:09:55.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cidden! Beynini mi düşürdün?Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.70,0:09:57.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama karaya çıkmak tehlikeli.Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.45,0:10:03.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yani şu bitkilere bi' bakın.Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.21,0:10:05.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunlar gördüğüm hiçbir botanik kitabında yok.Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.22,0:10:13.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok tatlı!Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.64,0:10:15.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben mi?Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.39,0:10:18.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tabii ki Nami-san'a diyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.06,0:10:19.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O da neydi?Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.85,0:10:23.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Endişelenme.Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.23,0:10:24.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sadece bir kuş.Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.52,0:10:26.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üstelik burası normal bir orman.Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.36,0:10:27.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Korkma.Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.07,0:10:31.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorun nedir?Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.24,0:10:39.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neyin var, seni kahrolası kuş?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.95,0:10:42.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kertenkele mi? Acaba tadı nasıl?Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.88,0:10:50.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu normal bir ormanda duyacağın bir ses mi?Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.13,0:10:55.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yanardağ patlıyor sandım!Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.90,0:11:08.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaplan mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.61,0:11:10.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok büyük!Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.58,0:11:21.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne...?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.74,0:11:23.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ona ne oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.54,0:11:26.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu hiç de normal değil. Kesinlikle değil!Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.79,0:11:30.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nasıl olur da ormanın efendisi kaplan, kendi kanında boğulur?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.38,0:11:36.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karaya çıkmamaya karar verildi!Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.64,0:11:40.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sessizce gemide bekleyeceğiz ve seyir ayarlandığında...Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.68,0:11:41.18,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.18,0:11:43.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...bu adayı derhâl terk edeceğiz.Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.60,0:11:44.56,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.56,0:11:47.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Alabasta'ya bir an önce varmalıyız!Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.36,0:11:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Öğle yemeği!Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.24,0:11:59.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yemek mi?Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.66,0:12:02.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet, gücümü tazelemek için!Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.70,0:12:06.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bol etli ve sebzesiz bir korsan yemeği!Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.29,0:12:07.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Macera kokusu alıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.67,0:12:11.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,D-Dur bakalım!Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.21,0:12:12.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nereye gidiyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.38,0:12:14.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maceraya!Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.26,0:12:16.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gelmek ister misin? Macera! Macera!Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.26,0:12:20.34,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Faydasız. Böyle heyecanlandı mı onu kimse durduramaz.Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.14,0:12:22.81,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Olamaz!Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.81,0:12:26.31,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,O dev kaplanı öldüren canavar hâlâ orada bir yerde!Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.31,0:12:28.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Öğle yemeği!Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Duydum.Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.85,0:12:31.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Az müsaade et.Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.40,0:12:36.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, seninle gelebilir miyim?Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.94,0:12:37.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.78,0:12:39.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tabii! Hadi! Hadi!Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.36,0:12:41.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bari sen yapma!Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.70,0:12:42.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maalesef.Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.70,0:12:45.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burada kalırsam, düşünmekten kafayı yerim.Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.70,0:12:48.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seyir netleşene kadar keşfe çıkıp kafa dağıtayım.Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.21,0:12:49.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yapamazsın!Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.04,0:12:51.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy tamam da senin için fazla tehlikeli bu!Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.38,0:12:54.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Endişelenme. Karoo da benimle olacak!Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.84,0:13:01.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama yüzü başka bir hikâye anlatıyor gibi.Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.55,0:13:04.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O hâlde Vivi-chan'a kalpten bir öğle yemeği hazırlayayım!Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.14,0:13:07.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karoo'ya da içeceklerinden biraz yapabilir misin?Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.98,0:13:09.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Elbette!Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.10,0:13:10.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bana bırakın!Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.53,0:13:17.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hazır!Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.41,0:13:27.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamamdır! İki kişilik korsan yemeği, Karoo'ya da özel içecekten!Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.75,0:13:29.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Artık hazırsınız.Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.04,0:13:30.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.92,0:13:37.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O zaman, sonra görüşürüz!Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ! Gidelim!Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.05,0:13:41.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yakında döneriz!Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.76,0:13:46.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bayan Wednesday çok cesur.Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.18,0:13:49.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne de olsa düşman bir örgüte sızmış biri.Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.23,0:13:55.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eh, ben de sıkıldım. Yürüyüşe çıkıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.11,0:13:56.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yürüyüş mü?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.36,0:14:00.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.11,0:14:02.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Az bekle!Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.61,0:14:05.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yiyecek stoğumuz tükendi.Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.49,0:14:08.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yiyebileceğimiz bir şeye rastlarsan buraya getir.Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.45,0:14:10.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam, olur.Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.29,0:14:14.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin asla yakalayamayacağın bir şey getireceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.58,0:14:15.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dur ulan!Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.46,0:14:17.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.09,0:14:20.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Böyle meydan okumalara pabuç bırakmam.Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.51,0:14:25.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cidden benim yakalayacağımdan daha büyüğünü mü yakalayacaksın?Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.89,0:14:27.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Elbette!Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.98,0:14:34.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Av müsabakası!Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.07,0:14:40.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dinle. Daha kilolu et getiren kazanır.Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.53,0:14:43.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tonlarca diyelim şuna...Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.82,0:14:46.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir şey yakaladığında artistlik yaparsın.Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.03,0:14:48.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aynen öyle!Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.16,0:14:53.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Al birini vur ötekine. Niye hepsi böyle olmak zorunda?Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.75,0:14:55.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nasıl hissettiğini çok iyi anlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.71,0:14:58.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ağlama. Ben seninleyim .Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.38,0:15:05.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Boku yedim.Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.38,0:15:07.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu ben diyecektim be!Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.18,0:15:13.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama dur biraz.Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.44,0:15:16.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha? N-N-Ne oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.19,0:15:20.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-N-N-Nami?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.11,0:15:21.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu değil.Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.98,0:15:23.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu da değil.Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.07,0:15:25.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Uf, ah! H-Hey, Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.49,0:15:28.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Hey! Ne arıyorsun be?Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.37,0:15:30.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu kitaplardan birinde okuduğumu hatırlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.45,0:15:33.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne... Neyi?Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.54,0:15:34.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Little Garden'ı.Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.87,0:15:36.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hop!Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.54,0:15:39.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.54,0:15:40.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte, şuna bak!Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.21,0:15:43.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kabuklu bir kalamar gibi görünüyor.Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.22,0:15:48.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kabuklu kalamar!Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.09,0:15:52.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fosil gibi görünüyor.Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.18,0:15:53.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kabuklu kalamar mı?Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.49,0:16:08.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neden takip ediliyormuşum gibi hissediyorum?Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.78,0:16:10.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanırım bana öyle geldi.Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.42,0:16:26.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aman!Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.59,0:16:29.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oyun oynamayı kes!Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.84,0:16:32.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Boyun Vuruşu!Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.36,0:16:46.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu da ne böyle?Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.32,0:16:47.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yenir mi acaba?Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.86,0:16:51.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir bakalım...Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.32,0:16:52.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hangisindeydi?Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.28,0:16:56.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yakın zamanda okuduğuma eminim ama aklımdan çıkmış.Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.67,0:17:04.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey...Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.59,0:17:07.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neden karada bir deniz kralı var?Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.64,0:17:12.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dinozor!Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.97,0:17:14.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dinozor mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.60,0:17:17.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse burası tarih öncesi bir ada!Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.43,0:17:18.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hah?Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.45,0:17:22.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu ada hâlâ dinozor çağında!Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.55,0:17:23.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh?Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.52,0:17:28.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Grand Line'da yolculuk çok zorlu olduğu için...Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.86,0:17:31.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ticaret ve kültürel etkileşim pek görülmez.Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.49,0:17:34.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Böylece her ada, kendine has tarzıyla var olur.Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.83,0:17:39.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bazı adalar inanılmaz derecede gelişmişken,Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.75,0:17:43.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,diğerlerinin ilerlemesi binlerce,Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.25,0:17:47.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,hatta on binlerce yıl boyunca durmuş, değişmeden kalmış.Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.51,0:17:54.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Grand Line'daki dengesiz iklim bunu mümkün kılmış olabilir.Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.18,0:18:00.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu ada bu yüzden dinozor çağında olmalı!Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.68,0:18:02.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Müthiş!Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.89,0:18:03.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.36,0:18:09.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ona tırmanma!Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.15,0:18:11.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.24,0:18:12.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.99,0:18:15.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha? Ne? Ne oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.78,0:18:17.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kitabı buldun mu?Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.74,0:18:19.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buldum.Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.96,0:18:31.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok kötü.Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.01,0:18:32.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu ada...Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.03,0:18:55.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.82,0:18:59.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanki Nami-san'ın beni çağırdığını duydum.Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.37,0:19:08.92,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,Burada yaşayanlar için bu ada, tıpkı küçük bir bahçe.Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.38,0:19:11.55,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,Little Garden...Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.59,0:19:14.72,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,Buraya bu ismi vereceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.72,0:19:18.10,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaşif, Louis Arnote.Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.15,0:19:34.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet?Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.61,0:19:36.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cevap verin?Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.45,0:19:39.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Affedersiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.07,0:19:41.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tekrar sorabilir misiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.29,0:19:45.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hiç içkiniz var mı diye sordum?Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.58,0:19:48.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Biraz olabilir.Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.04,0:19:51.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Demek, var!Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.21,0:19:55.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,E-Elimizdekiler içmelik değil, yemek yapmak ve dezenfekte etmek için!Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.63,0:19:58.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama istiyorsanız hepsini alabilirsiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.23,0:20:07.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dino...Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.39,0:20:08.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dinozor mu?Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.79,0:20:28.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben, Elbaf'ın kudretli savaşçısı Brogy'im!Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.71,0:20:36.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Artık etim var.Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.34,0:20:38.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Misafirim olarak bana katılın.Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.97,0:20:45.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,H-Hey.Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.10,0:20:49.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-Ne olursa olsun ölü numarası yap.Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.98,0:20:54.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ö-Ölü numarası yapmak sadece ayılarda işe yaramıyor mu?Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.62,0:21:04.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vay canına!Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.79,0:21:07.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne harika bir manzara!Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.41,0:21:10.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öğle yemeğimi burada yemek istiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.42,0:21:14.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-Boş konuşmanın sırası değil!Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.17,0:21:19.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Harbiden yanardağlar var.Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.88,0:21:23.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ve kocaman delikleri olan bir dağ da var.Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.31,0:21:26.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok tehlikeli!Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.39,0:21:28.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İn aşağıya!Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.11,0:21:39.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu yedi!Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.49,0:21:43.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neredeyim ben?Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.11,0:22:24.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oha...!Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.33,0:22:28.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni izliyordum!Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.62,0:22:31.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ormandaki uzun boyunlularla oynuyordun.Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.87,0:22:33.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayat dolusun!Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.79,0:22:35.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Misafirim olmayalı uzun zaman oldu.Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.29,0:22:38.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dev gibisin! İnsan mısın sen?Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.42,0:22:45.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben, Elbaf'ın kudretli savaşçısı Dorry'im!Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.72,0:22:50.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-Bu bir dev.Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.52,0:22:55.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onları duymuştum ama ilk kez canlı görüyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.31,0:22:58.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben, Luffy. Korsanım!Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.44,0:23:02.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Korsan mı?! Bu harika!Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.40,0:23:05.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karoo! Uyan!Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.91,0:23:07.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geç olmadan tüyelim!Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.99,0:23:11.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unutmadan! Şuradakiler Vivi ve Karoo. Tanıştığımıza sevindim!Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.20,0:23:14.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san, yine çenesini tutamadı.Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.63,0:23:20.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hepiniz mekânıma davetlisiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.11,0:23:43.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hadi yiyelim!Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.53,0:23:45.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dinozor etinin tadı harika!Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.37,0:23:50.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İ-İştahımı yitirdim.Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.37,0:23:53.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çekinmeyin! Yumulun!Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.29,0:23:57.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yemek istemiyoruz... – Yemek istemiyoruz...Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.96,0:24:02.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama bu dinozor eti çok iyi!Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.84,0:24:07.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İlk önce bize dinozor etini yedirecek ve...Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.09,0:24:08.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu bizi şişmanlatacak.Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.80,0:24:10.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...sonra da bizi yiyecek mi?Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.72,0:24:13.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet, devler böyle yapar.Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.60,0:24:16.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama çok genciz.Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.02,0:24:17.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tam da ağzına layığız!Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.64,0:24:20.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok yazık.Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.36,0:24:22.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cidden çok lezzetli.Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.36,0:24:27.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seyir ayarlanana dek kendimizi aç bırakıp zayıf tutarsak,Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.53,0:24:29.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,belki de hayatta kalabiliriz.Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.61,0:24:33.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama seyirin ayarlanması ne kadar sürecek?Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.41,0:24:39.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Et çok güzel kokuyor, kısa süre sonra kendimi tutamayacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.54,0:24:43.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Brogy-san, size küçük bir soru sorabilir miyim?Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.13,0:24:46.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorabilirsin, küçük kız?Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.97,0:24:50.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-Bu adada seyirin ayarlanması ne kadar sürer acaba?Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.64,0:24:52.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir yıl.Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.51,0:24:53.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Ne?! – Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.47,0:25:00.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayır! Koca bir yıl boyunca aç kalmamız mümkün değil.Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.23,0:25:03.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kendimi... tutamayacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.65,0:25:06.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden keyfinize bakın!Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.00,0:25:21.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu harika, ihtiyar dev!Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.75,0:25:25.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin şu "korsan yemeği" de fena değildi.Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.13,0:25:27.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama biraz küçüktü!Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.97,0:25:30.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tabii ki güzel olacak!Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.80,0:25:34.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Korsan gemimdeki aşçının yaptığı özel bir yemekti.Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.35,0:25:36.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kötü deseydin seni mahvederdim.Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.06,0:25:39.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mahveder miydin?Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.19,0:25:44.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok komiksin, evlat!Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.69,0:25:46.78,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,F-Fazlasıyla samimi olmaya başladılar.Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.44,0:25:50.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her neyse, burada niye yalnız yaşıyorsun ihtiyar?Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.40,0:25:53.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Köyün falan yok mu?Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.74,0:25:53.41,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Hah?Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.87,0:25:55.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet, bir köyüm var.Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.49,0:25:57.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Elbaf adında bir savaşçılar köyü.Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.49,0:26:00.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Grand Line'da bir yerde.Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.12,0:26:03.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama köyümüzün kanunları vardır.Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.92,0:26:05.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kanunlar mı?Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.59,0:26:10.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mesela, bir kavga çıkarsa ve taraflardan hiçbiri pes etmezse...Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.05,0:26:13.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Elbaf'ın tanrıları devreye girip hükmünü verir.Dialogue: 50,0:26:13.30,0:26:16.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tanrılar, dövüşte bir tarafı ilahi koruma ile onurlandırır...Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.64,0:26:18.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ve bu nedenle kazanan haklı görülür.Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.64,0:26:21.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Elbaf'ın tanrıları ha?Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.98,0:26:24.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir zamanlar böyle bir kavgaya giriştim.Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.60,0:26:28.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bugüne dek, başka biriyle yaptığımız düelloya bu ada ev sahipliği yapıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.94,0:26:32.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dövüşü kazanan haklı görülüp yaşayacak.Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.61,0:26:36.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama 100 yıl oldu ve hâlâ bir sonuca vardıramadık!Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.95,0:26:40.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,100 yıldır dövüşüyor musunuz?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.00,0:26:43.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şaşılacak bir şey değil.Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.25,0:26:47.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ömrümüz, sizinkinden en az üç kat daha uzun.Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.30,0:26:51.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üç kat daha uzun yaşasanız bile...Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.09,0:26:53.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,100 yıl boyunca dövüşülür mü?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.38,0:26:56.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Niye bu kadar uzun süre devam ettiniz?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.76,0:26:58.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ölümüne bir dövüş mü?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.10,0:27:07.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oha!Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.44,0:27:10.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok büyük bir patlamaydı!Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.90,0:27:13.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ, gitme vakti.Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.74,0:27:14.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:27:21.66,0:27:22.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O da ne?Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.91,0:27:24.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir patlama...Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.79,0:27:28.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.33,0:27:29.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N...?Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.30,0:27:35.18,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Aniden çok ciddileşti.Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.63,0:27:39.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm, kısa bir süreliğine gitmem lazım.Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.85,0:27:42.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne? Gitmek mi?Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.27,0:27:43.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.06,0:27:47.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Patlama, 100 yıllık düelloma devam etmem için beni çağırıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.73,0:27:49.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Düello mu?Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.11,0:27:52.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,K-Kime karşı? Nerede?! Ne sebeple?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.28,0:27:53.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sebep mi?Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.11,0:27:55.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hatırlamıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.03,0:28:01.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Farkına bile varmadan rutinimiz hâline geldi.Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.41,0:28:06.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Merkez dağın patlaması, düellomuzun işaretidir.Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.00,0:28:08.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.17,0:28:11.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,100 yıl boyunca birine bu kadar kin tutmak, akıl alır şey değil!Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.30,0:28:14.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu kavga niye başladı?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.13,0:28:16.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karışma.Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.38,0:28:19.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunun bir önemi yok.Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.48,0:28:28.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aynen. Gurur meselesi bu!Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.24,0:28:39.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dövüşme sebebimizi...Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.66,0:28:44.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,unutalı çok oldu!Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:57.47,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,Little Garden MacerasıDialogue: 1,0:01:49.96,0:01:57.47,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,Little Garden MacerasıDialogue: 0,0:06:46.55,0:06:50.60,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Tatil Adası Grand LineDialogue: 1,0:06:46.55,0:06:50.60,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Tatil Adası Grand LineDialogue: 2,0:06:46.55,0:06:50.60,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Tatil Adası Grand LineDialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:31.85,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bay 3 Baroque Works Rütbeli AjanıDialogue: 1,0:07:26.30,0:07:31.85,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bay 3 Baroque Works Rütbeli AjanıDialogue: 2,0:07:26.30,0:07:31.85,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bay 3 Baroque Works Rütbeli AjanıDialogue: 0,0:07:38.27,0:07:41.48,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bayan Golden Week Baroque Works Rütbeli AjanıDialogue: 1,0:07:38.27,0:07:41.48,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bayan Golden Week Baroque Works'ün Rütbeli AjanıDialogue: 2,0:07:38.27,0:07:41.48,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bayan Golden Week Baroque Works'ün Rütbeli AjanıDialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:36.70,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Dev BrogyDialogue: 1,0:19:33.53,0:19:36.70,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Dev BrogyDialogue: 2,0:19:33.53,0:19:36.70,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Dev BrogyDialogue: 0,0:22:25.37,0: